# CODEOWNERS is the human-visibility half of the spine policy: it puts a named person on the review
# of anything touching the five guarantees the platform exists to provide. The ENFORCING half is
# `.github/scripts/pr-gates.mjs`, which fails as a required status check — CODEOWNERS only requests a
# review, and only blocks if you also turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in branch protection.
#
# Keep both. The check is what stops an agent; the ownership is what tells you it happened.

